                                "sense_id": "16d8edc1-7957-3a08-a1e9-404f5fd4206f",
                                "text": "The doctrine of 'pre-Adamitism,' while heretical and guaranteed to generate storms of controversy, won some prominent adherents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57fb13d6-8ac9-43df-964e-1af0fd8ddf04",
                                "sense_id": "16d8edc1-7957-3a08-a1e9-404f5fd4206f",
                                "text": "He probably also had theological reasons for not considering pre-Adamitism."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
